                // restart, SAVE/LOAD; 'd' seen list, MarkMsgSeen above). A pending uuid is never already seen, so a treasureId
                // match here is a DIFFERENT post (treasureId is only the treasure type, 25193 on 3 posts) -> report it, never by coords.
